joycaption_lib/prompts.py keeps the caption types and the extra-options list
of JoyCaption's demo (the fancyfeast/joy-caption-beta-one Space on Hugging
Face, which states no license; the same prompts are in the repository above)
and adds its own. The rest of this extension is distributed under the
repository's GNU AGPL v3.

The JoyCaption model weights are downloaded on first use, not redistributed.
